{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood of the North </strong>is a survival game with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, build, and battle dragons to reclaim what was lost to the North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between islands, explore ancient lands, and rebuild what was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, fortify buildings, and strengthen your hero to face increasingly dangerous enemies \u2014 alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESOURCE GATHERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island, gather useful materials, and manage your inventory to develop your base and unlock new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build workshops, weapon shops, and taverns to expand your settlement's capabilities. Each building opens up new paths for development and strengthens your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAGON BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to other islands and engage in fierce battles with dragons. Each battle is a test, a reward, and a chance to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABILITY UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls and spend them to enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cooperatively. Joint battles make survival even more interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/dd1f2c96e08805f2700edd7c63d6a74d.avif?t=1766787344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras_big/dd1f2c96e08805f2700edd7c63d6a74d.webp?t=1766787344 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088290?t=1766787344","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088290?t=1766787344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/65a42e295784e09704f8343f64d3577465bd465e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766787344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/65a42e295784e09704f8343f64d3577465bd465e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766787344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood of the North </strong>is a survival game with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, build, and battle dragons to reclaim what was lost to the North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between islands, explore ancient lands, and rebuild what was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, fortify buildings, and strengthen your hero to face increasingly dangerous enemies \u2014 alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESOURCE GATHERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island, gather useful materials, and manage your inventory to develop your base and unlock new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/e2eb744bbe483c4a04c10085608de99f.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILDING CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build workshops, weapon shops, and taverns to expand your settlement's capabilities. Each building opens up new paths for development and strengthens your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a5ccfca04f19edcaa4707d7e2c2eda2c.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAGON BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to other islands and engage in fierce battles with dragons. Each battle is a test, a reward, and a chance to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/a9ca00e510a06bb4613dad0e6f827cfb.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABILITY UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls and spend them to enhance your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.poster.avif?t=1766787344\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.webm?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/bfddd183d56bacdeae4d1a67b745132f.mp4?t=1766787344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cooperatively. Joint battles make survival even more interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras/dd1f2c96e08805f2700edd7c63d6a74d.avif?t=1766787344\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088290/extras_big/dd1f2c96e08805f2700edd7c63d6a74d.webp?t=1766787344 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["HP Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a